---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Explore and call MCP servers: their tools, resources and prompts

Usage: rustman mcp-client [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  tools      List the tools of an MCP server
  call       Call a tool of an MCP server
  resources  List the resources of an MCP server, or read one
  prompts    List the prompts of an MCP server, or get one
  logout     Delete the OAuth tokens stored for an MCP server
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
